<title>UK: NordLB adds 600 million marks to June 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB adds 600 million marks to June 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible pfandbrief bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Dresdner Bank, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    15.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.635    PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     LISTING    HANN/FFT  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	TOTAL SIZE NOW 2.6 BILLION MARKS.</p>
<p> NOTES     SALOMON BROTHERS ARE ALSO JOINT LEAD MANAGERS</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.165     DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
